cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "IFCFill: missingness-aware preprocessing for synthetic data generation"
abstract: >-
  IFCFill transforms incomplete tabular data into Integer, Float and
  Categorical (IFC) variables that synthetic-data generators can consume, and
  reconstructs the original representation and missingness after synthesis.
